WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Come and take a look, everyone

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:02,360
We have activities today

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,560
Annual fee 3,600

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,600
Just pay three thousand six

5
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,800
You can come to our fitness and sports boss at any time

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,400
Is she your coach? Yes.

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,000
If she were the coach, I would come

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,960
She is our coach, right?

9
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,720
She is the best coach we have here

10
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,160
You just need to apply for a card with us

11
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,600
Then you can see her often

12
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,600
And I can ask her to give me some pointers. Haha, boss.

13
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,520
Then she can't give private lessons, right?

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,000
How much does one private lesson cost for her?

15
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:26,920
Why not open

16
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,800
It’s just that you’ve seen how powerful she is.

17
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,000
If I were to take private lessons from her

18
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,520
It's not that cheap. Haha, it doesn't matter.

19
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:36,000
As long as she opens it, that’s fine. Boss, if I open a card, I want to open a card too.

20
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,000
Are there any red camp guns or something like that?

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:51,630
This is all done in the gym

22
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:53,310
I also have to sign up, right, right, right

23
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:55,390
I feel envious when I see other people’s figures.

24
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:58,030
Look how big my belly is. I need to lose weight.
